// Triple Cross eBPF Rootkit Default Persistence | T1053.003 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/linux/file_event/file_event_lnx_triple_cross_rootkit_persistence.yml
TargetFilename:*ebpfbackdoor

// Stellar Cyber Query Builder (DSL):
{
  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "must": [
        {
          "query_string": {
            "query": "TargetFilename:*ebpfbackdoor",
            "analyze_wildcard": true
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
